  "problems": "abercrombie.com redirects to the EU store from this location, and there is no standalone size-chart page (/help/size-charts returns 404); the chart was read from the product-page \"Size Guide\" dialog with region EU and CM selected. An IN option and USA/Italy/UK/Japan/Korea/China region views exist but were not captured, so no US aliases are recorded. Curve Love has the same waist ranges with larger hips (fit_line). Range ends are shared between neighbouring sizes (e.g. 60 ends 23 and starts 24). EU aliases repeat (25 and 26 are both EU 36). Inseam is not per size: lengths are Extra Short / Short / Regular / Long (an Extra Long length is sold but has no height band). The same dialog shows per-product garment measurements (e.g. Regular Inseam 31.50 for size 28 / 6) that vary by style; not recorded."
}